\n\n=\n+\n−\n−\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nattempt to substitute into\nnS and equate to 3ln x\n−\n(M1)\n1\n2ln\n(\n1)\nln\n3ln\n2\n3\nn\nx\nn\nx\nx\n\n\n\n\n+\n−\n−\n= −\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\ncorrect working with\nnS (seen anywhere)\n(A1)\nOR\n(\n)1\nln\nln\n6\nn n\nn\nx\nx\n−\n−\nOR\n1\n2\nln\nn\nn\nl\nl\n2\n3\n3\nn\nn\nx\nx\nx\n\n\n−\n+\n\n\n\n\n4\nln\nln\n2\n3\nn\nn\nx\nx\n\n−\n\n\n\n+ \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\ncorrect equation without ln x\nA1\nOR\n(\n)1\n3\n6\nn n\nn\n−\n−\n= −\nor equivalent\n7\n3\n2 3\n3\nn\nn\n\n\n−\n= −\n\n\n\n\nNote: Award as above if the series\n1\n1\n...\n3\np\n+\n+\n+\nis considered leading to\n.\n7\n3\n2 3\n3\nn\nn\n\n\n−\n= −\n\n\n\n\nattempt to form a quadratic\n0\n=\n(M1)\n2\n7\n18\n0\nn\nn\n−\n−\n=\nattempt to solve their quadratic\n(M1)\n(\n9)(\n2)\n0\nn\nn\n−\n+\n=\n9\nn =\nA1\ncontinued…\n– 22 –\nM22/5/MATHX/SP1/ENG/TZ1/XX/M\nQuestion 8 continued\nMETHOD 2\nlisting the first 7 terms of the sequence\n(A1)\n2\n1\n1\n2\nln\nln\nln\n0\nln\nln\nln\n...\n3\n3\n3\n3\nx\nx\nx\nx\nx\nx\n+\n+\n+\n−\n−\n−\n+\nrecognizing first 7 terms sum to 0\nM1\n8th term is\n4 ln\n3\nx\n−\n(A1)\n9th term is\n5ln\n3\nx\n−\n(A1)\nsum of 8th and 9th terms\n3ln x\n= −\n(A1)\n9\nn =\nA1\n[10 marks]\nTotal [15 marks]",
